      "name": "ask_workmate",
      "description": "Start a background question to the 1C:Workmate plugin and return its jobId. Hands the question to an EXTERNAL agent: by default (shareMcpTools) Workmate may call EDT-MCP's own tools through this plugin, so it can READ the project and CHANGE code and metadata; workmateTool mode runs a named Workmate tool directly (JShell included). Poll the job with get_job_status instead of calling ask_workmate again. Requires a compatible Workmate installation in the same EDT JVM. Full parameters and examples: call get_tool_guide('ask_workmate').",
